      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779014977029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Title\n\nDescription\n    - Short Description\n    - Brief Description\n\nEvent Timing\n    - Start Date\n    - End Date\n    - timezone\n\nStatus\n    - Ongoing\n    - Upcoming\n    - Completed\n\nRegistration \n    - Registration Deadline\n\nMode of the Event\n    - Online\n    - Offline\n        \nslug (SEO friendly URL)\n\nTag (Searching / Filtering)\n\nEventBanner\n\nThumbnail\n\nCategory\n    - Examples:\n        Music, Hackathon, Quiz, Workshop, college, etc...\n\nTicketing System\n    - isFree\n    - ticket Price\n    - currency\n    - total seats\n    - available seats\n    - max Tickets Per User\n\n\n\nAttendees / Registration\n\nattendees: [\n    {\n        Student: {\n            type,\n            ref: \"Student\"\n        },\n    registeredAt,\n    ticketType,\n    paymentstatus,\n    checkInstatus\n    }\n]\n\n\nVisibility & Permissions\n    - isPublic\n    - allowedColleges\n    - requiresApproval\n\n\nAnalytics fields\n    - views\n    - shares\n    - favorites Count\n    - Registration Count\n\n\nReview and Feedback\n    ratings: [\n        {\n            User,\n            rating,\n            review\n        }\n    ]\n\n\nSponsor & Partners\n    sponsors: [\n        {\n            name,\n            logo,\n            website\n        }\n    ]\n\n\nContact Information\n    contact Email,\n    contact Phone,\n    website\n    socialLinks\n\n\nSecurity & Moderation\n    - terms & Conditions\n    - refund Policy\n    - report Count\n    \n\nMetadata\n    - created at\n    - updated at\n    - created by\n    - updated by",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Title\n\nDescription\n    - Short Description\n    - Brief Description\n\nEvent Timing\n    - Start Date\n    - End Date\n    - timezone\n\nStatus\n    - Ongoing\n    - Upcoming\n    - Completed\n\nRegistration \n    - Registration Deadline\n\nMode of the Event\n    - Online\n    - Offline\n        \nslug (SEO friendly URL)\n\nTag (Searching / Filtering)\n\nEventBanner\n\nThumbnail\n\nCategory\n    - Examples:\n        Music, Hackathon, Quiz, Workshop, college, etc...\n\nTicketing System\n    - isFree\n    - ticket Price\n    - currency\n    - total seats\n    - available seats\n    - max Tickets Per User\n\n\n\nAttendees / Registration\n\nattendees: [\n    {\n        Student: {\n            type,\n            ref: \"Student\"\n        },\n    registeredAt,\n    ticketType,\n    paymentstatus,\n    checkInstatus\n    }\n]\n\n\nVisibility & Permissions\n    - isPublic\n    - allowedColleges\n    - requiresApproval\n\n\nAnalytics fields\n    - views\n    - shares\n    - favorites Count\n    - Registration Count\n\n\nReview and Feedback\n    ratings: [\n        {\n            User,\n            rating,\n            review\n        }\n    ]\n\n\nSponsor & Partners\n    sponsors: [\n        {\n            name,\n            logo,\n            website\n        }\n    ]\n\n\nContact Information\n    contact Email,\n    contact Phone,\n    website\n    socialLinks\n\n\nSecurity & Moderation\n    - terms & Conditions\n    - refund Policy\n    - report Count\n    \n\nMetadata\n    - created at\n    - updated at\n    - created by\n    - updated by",
