      "text": "1. Connected the Register User Page to the Backend\n\n2. Fix the Dashboard only display the vaild details and removing\n    all the sample dummy data that is entered currently.\n\n3. Fix the Dashboard of admin only display the vaild Data only \n    in the frontend and make the admin dashboard available to\n    only admin no participants can access them.",
