      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A, B, C, D are the Participant of the XYZ Hackathon.\nNow A wants to create a team.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A, B, C, D are the Participant of the XYZ Hackathon.\nNow A wants to create a team.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xAeo4rxIwfzZgSjc7jRq_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1149.931426804148,
      "y": 8656.51185684933,
      "width": 579.0396118164062,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1191460462,
      "version": 1036,
      "versionNonce": 903432754,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780637997675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So now what A will do is he searches for the list of the \nusers participated in the hackathon but not in any team \nso now he found 3 people B, C, D now A wants to add \nthem in their team for this hackathon.So A created one \nteam then send the team join resquest to each of them\nthe users B, C, D receives the team invitation in their\ninbox and they also receive the mail to join the team \nthey can see their team invitation their and \ndecides weather they want to join the team or not \nadd the proper links and all to redirect them once \nthey are approved the join the team request. If\nthe user accepts the invitation add them in the team \nand so the team details to captain and team members also.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So now what A will do is he searches for the list of the \nusers participated in the hackathon but not in any team \nso now he found 3 people B, C, D now A wants to add \nthem in their team for this hackathon.So A created one \nteam then send the team join resquest to each of them\nthe users B, C, D receives the team invitation in their\ninbox and they also receive the mail to join the team \nthey can see their team invitation their and \ndecides weather they want to join the team or not \nadd the proper links and all to redirect them once \nthey are approved the join the team request. If\nthe user accepts the invitation add them in the team \nand so the team details to captain and team members also.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
